hadiths[108]{hadithnumber,text}:
"6607","aik shakhs jo musalmanon ki taraf se badi bahaadurii se lad raha tha aur us jang main Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) bhi maujood they. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne dekha aur farmaya ke jo kisi jahannami shakhs ko dekhnaa chahta hai wo us shakhs ko dekh ley chunanche wo shakhs jab isi tarah ladney mein masroof tha aur mushrekeen ko apni bahaadurii ki wjah se sakht tar takaaleef mein mubtala kar raha tha to aik musalman uske peechhey peechhey chala , aakhir wo shakhs zakhmi ho gaya aur jaldi se mar jana chaha , isliye us ne apni talwaar ki dhaar apne seeney par laga li aur talwaar uske shaanon ko paar karti hui nikal gaee. iske baad peechhaa karne wala shakhs Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khidmat mein daudta hua hazir hua aur arz kya, main gawahi deta hun ke aap Allah ke rasool hain. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke baat kya hai? un sahib ne kaha ke aap ne falan shakhs ke barey mein farmaya tha ke jo kisi jahannami ko dekhnaa chahta hai wo us shakhs ko dekh ley halanke wo shakhs musalmanon ki taraf se badi bahaadurii se lad raha tha. main samjha ke wo us haalat mein nahi marega. lekin jab wo zakhmi ho gaya to jaldi se mar janey ki khahish mein us ne khudkushii kar li. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke banda dozkhiyon ke se kaam karta rehta hai halanke wo jannati hota hai (usi tarah doosra banda ( jannatiyon ke kaam karta rehta hai halanke wo dozakhi hota hai, bila shubah amalon ka eitibaar khaatme par hai."
"6608","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne nazar manney se mana kya tha aur farmaya tha ke nazar kisi cheez ko nahi lautaatii, nazar sirf kanjoos ke dil se paisaa nikaaltii hai."
"6609","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke nazar ( mannat ( insan ko koi cheez nahi deti jo main ( rab ( ne uski taqdeer mein na likhi ho balke wo taqdeer deti hai jo main ( rab ( ne uske liye muqarrar kar di hai, albatta iske zariey mein kanjoos ka maal nikalwaa leta hun."
"6610","ham Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke sath aik jang mein they aur jab bhi ham kisi bulandi par chadhtey ya kisi nashebii ilaqe mein utartey to takbeer buland awaz se kehtey. bayan kya ke phir Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) hamarey qareeb aaey aur farmaya ''aey logo ! apne aap par raham karo, kyonke tum kisi behrey ya ghair maujood ko nahi pukaartey balke tum us zaat ko pukaartey ho jo bahut zyada sunney wala bada dekhney wala hai.'' phir farmaya : aey Abdullah-bin-Qais ! ( abu-Musa Ash-ari (Raziallahu anhu)) kya main tumhen aik kalima na sikhaa dun jo jannat ke khazaanon mein se hai. (wo kalima hai) لا حول wla قوة إلا بالله yaanii taqat w quwwat Allah ke siwa aur kisi ke paas nahi."
"6611","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya '' jab bhi koi shakhs Hakim hota hai to uske salaahkaar aur musheer 2 tarah ke hotey hain aik to wo jo usey neki aur bhalai ka hukm detey hain aur is par Ubhaartey rahtey hain aur doosrey wo jo usey burai ka hukm detey hain aur is par usey Ubhaartey rahtey hain aur masoom wo hai jisey Allah mehfooz rakhey.''"
"6612","ye jo ( لمم (ka lafz Quran mein aaya hai to main ( لمم (ke mushabeh (similar) is baat se zyada koi baat nahi janta jo Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) ne Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se bayan ki hai ke Allah Taala ne insan ke liye zina ka koi na koi hissey likh diya hai jis se usey laa-muhaalaa guzarna hai, to aankh ka zina ( ghair-maharam ko) dekhnaa hai, zaban ka zina ghair-maharam se guftgu karna hai, dil ka zina khahish aur shahwat hai aur sharmgah uski tasdeeq kar deti hai ya usey jhutlaa deti hai. aur Shababaa ne bayan kya ke ham se Warqaa ne bayan kya, unse ibne-Taaoos ne, unse unke walid ne, unse Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) ne, unhon-ne Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se phir us hadis ko naql kya."
"6613","aur unse Ibne-Abbas (Raziallahu anhu) ne aayat ( وما جعلنا الرؤيا التي أريناك إلا فتنة للناس‏ ( ''aur wo rua'yaa jo ham ne tumhen dikhaya hai usey ham ne sirf logon ke liye aazmaish banaya hai.'' ke mutaalliq kaha ke us se murad aankh ka dekhnaa hai jo Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko us meraaj ki raat dikhaya gaya tha. jab aapko baitul-maqdis tak raat ko ley jaya gaya tha, kaha ke Quran Majeed main ( الشجرة الملعونة ( se murad ( zaqqoom . Mina (ka darakht hai."
"6614","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne irshad farmaya '' Adam aur Musa ne mubaahasa kya. Musa (Alaihissalam) ne Adam (Alaihissalam) se kaha : Adam ! aap hamarey bap hain magar aap hi ne hamein mahroom kya aur jannat se nikala . Adam (Alaihissalam) ne Musa (Alaihissalam) se kaha Musa aapko Allah Taala ne ham kalaamii ke liye barguzeeda kya aur apne hath se aap ke liye Taurait ko likha . kya aap mujhey aik aisey kaam par malaamat kartey hain jo Allah Taala ne mujhey paida karne se chalis (40) saal pahley meri taqdeer mein likh diya tha. aakhir Adam (Alaihissalam) bahas mein Musa (Alaihissalam) par ghalib aaey. teen martaba Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne ye jumla farmaya, Sufiyan ne usi asnaad se bayan kya, kaha ham se abu-Zinaad ne bayan kya, unse Aaraj ne, unse Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) ne Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se phir yahi hadis naql ki."
"6615","Muawiya (Raziallahu anhu) ne Mughira-bin-Shoba (Raziallahu anhu) ko likha mujhey Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki wo dua likh kar bhejo jo tum ne Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko Namaz ke baad kartey suni hai. chunanche Mughira (Raziallahu anhu) ne mujh ko likhwaayaa . unhon-ne kaha ke maine Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se suna hai Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) har farz Namaz ke baad ye dua kya kartey they اللهم لا مانع لما أعطيت ، Mina wla معطي لما منعت ، Mina wla ينفع ذا الجد منك الجد ''Allaah ke siwa koi maabood nahi wo aik hai iska koi Sharik nahi, aey Allah ! jo to dena chahey usey koi rokney wala nahi aur jo to roknaa chahey usey koi dene wala nahi aur terey samney daulat waley ki daulat kuchh kaam nahi de sakti aur ibne-Juraij ne kaha ke mujh ko Abda ne khabar di aur unhein Wardaa ne khabar di, phir iske baad main Muawiya (Raziallahu anhu) ke yahan gaya to maine dekha ke wo logon ko is dua ke padhney ka hukm de rahe they."
"6616","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''Allah se panah maanga karo aazmaish ki mashaqqat, bad-bakhtii ki pastii, burey khaatmey aur dushman ke hansney se."
"6617","aksar Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) qism khaya kartey they ke nahi ! dilon ko pherney waley ki qasam."
"6618","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne ibne-Sayyaad se farmaya ke maine terey liye aik baat dil mein chipa rakhi hai) bata wo kya hai? ( usne kaha ke '' dhuaan '' Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke bad-bakht ! apni haisiyat se aagey na badh . umr (Raziallahu anhu) ne arz kya : aap mujhey ijazat dein to main uski gardan mar dun. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke usey chhod do, agar ye wahi ( dajjal ( hua to tum is par qaabu nahi pa saktey aur agar ye wo na hua to usey qatl karne main tumharey liye koi bhalai nahi."
"6619","unhon-ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se taaoon ke mutaalliq puchha to Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke ye azab tha aur Allah Taala jis par chahta hai usey bhejta tha. phir Allah Taala ne usey mominon ke liye rehmat bana diya, koi bhi banda agar kisi aisey Shahar mein hai jis mein taaoon ki wabaa phootii hui hai aur is mein thehra hai aur us Shahar se bhaagaa nahi sabr kiye huey hai aur is par ajr ka ummeedwaar hai aur yaqin rakhta hai ke us tak sirf wahi cheez pahunch sakti hai jo Allah ne uski taqdeer mein likh di hai to usey Shahid ke barabar sawab milega."
"6620","maine Khandaq ki jang ke din Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko dekha ke aap hamarey sath mitti utha rahe they aur ye kehtey jatey they. ''Allah ki qism , agar Allah na hota to ham hidayat na pa saktey. na roza rakh saktey aur na Namaz padh saktey. to aey Allah ! ham par sakeenat nazil farma aur jab saamnaa ho to hamein Sabit qadam rakh aur mushrekeen ne ham par zyadti ki hai. jab wo kisi fitne ka irada kartey hain to ham inkar kartey hain.''"
"6621","Abu-Bakar (Raziallahu anhu) kabhi apni qism nahi todtey they, yahan tak ke Allah Taala ne qism ka kaffara utaaraa. us waqt unhon-ne kaha ke ab agar main koi qism khaaunga aur uske siwa koi cheez bhalai ki hogi to main wahi kaam karunga jis mein bhalai ho aur apni qism ka kaffara de doonga ."
"6622","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''aey Abdur-Rehman bin Samra ! kabhi kisi hukumat ke ohda ki darkhaast na karna kyonke agar tumhen ye maangney ke baad milega to Allah paak apni madad tujh se utha lega, to jaan , tera kaam janey aur agar wo ohda tumhen baghair maangey mil gaya to usmein Allah ki taraf se tumhari iaa'nat ki jaeygi aur jab tum koi qism kha lo aur uske siwa kisi aur cheez mein bhalai dekho to apni qism ka kaffara de do aur wo kaam karo jo bhalai ka ho."
"6623","mein Ash-ari qabeele ki aik jamat ke sath Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khidmat mein hazir hua aur aap se sawari mangi . Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke Allah ki qism , main tumharey liye sawari ka koi intizam nahi kar sakta aur na mere paas koi sawari ka janwar hai. bayan kya phir jitney dinon Allah ne chaha ham yoonhii thahrey rahe. iske baad teen achi qism ki oontniyan laai gain aur Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne unhein hamein sawari ke liye inayat farmaya, jab ham rawaana huey to ham ne kaha ya ham mein se kuchh ne kaha, Allah ki qism ! hamein usmein barkat nahi hasil hogi. ham Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khidmat mein sawari maangney aaey they, to aap ne qism kha li thi ke aap hamarey liye sawari ka intizam nahi kar saktey aur ab aap ne hamein sawari inayat farmai hai hamein Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke paas jana chahiye aur aapko qism yad dilaanii chahiye chunanche ham aap ki khidmat mein hazir huey to Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke maine tumhari sawari ka koi intizam nahi kya hai balke Allah Taala ne ye intizam kya hai aur main, Allah ki qasam! koi bhi qism agar kha loonga aur uske siwa kisi aur cheez mein bhalai dekhoonga to apni qism ka kaffara de doonga. jis mein bhalai hogi ya Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne yun farmaya ke wahi karunga jis mein bhalai hogi aur apni qism ka kaffara ada kar doonga."
"6624","ye wo hadis hai jo ham se Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) ne bayan ki ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke ''ham aakhiri ummat hain aur qiyamat ke din jannat mein sabse pahley dakhil hongey. ''"
"6625","phir Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke Allah ki qism ( kabhi-kabhi ( apne ghar walon ke maamle main tumhara apni qasmon par israar kartey rehna Allah ke nazdeek us se zyada gunah ki baat hoti hai ke) qism tod kar) uska wo kaffara ada kar diya jaey jo Allah Taala ne is par farz kya hai."
"6626","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''wo shakhs jo apne ghar walon ke maamle mein qism par ada rehta hai wo us se bada gunah karta hai ke is qism ka kaffara ada kar de. ''"
"6627","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne aik fauj bheji aur uska ameer Usama-bin-Zaid ko banaya. kuchh logon ne unke ameer banaey janey par aetraz kya to Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) khadey huey aur farmaya ke agar tum log iske ameer banaey janey par aetraz kartey ho to tum us se pahley iske walid Zaid ke ameer banaey janey par bhi aetraz kar chukey ho aur Allah ki qism ! Zaid ameer banaey janey ke qaabil they aur mujhey sab logon se zyada azeez they aur ye ( Usama ( unke baad mujhey sabse zyada azeez they."
"6628","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki qism bas itni thi ke nahi ! dilon ke pherney waley Allah ki qism ."
"6629","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya '' jab qaisar halaak ho jaeyga to phir uske baad koi qaisar nahi paida hoga aur jab Kisraa halaak ho jaeyga to iske baad koi Kisraa nahi paida hoga aur us zaat ki qism jiske hath mein meri jaan hai tum unke khazaaney Allah ke rastey mein kharch karogey.''"
"6630","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya '' jab Kisraa ( badshah Iraan ( halaak ho jaeyga to iske baad koi Kisraa nahi paida hoga aur jab qaisar ( badshah Rome (mojooda Itly) ( halaak ho jaeyga to iske baad koi qaisar nahi paida hoga aur us zaat ki qism jiske hath mein meri jaan hai tum unke khazaaney Allah ke rastey mein kharch karogey. ''"
"6631","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''aey ummate-Muhammad ! Allah ki qism , agar tum wo jantey jo main janta hun to zyada rotey aur kam hanstey.''"
"6632","ham Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke sath they aur aap umr bin-Khattab (Raziallahu anhu) ka hath pakdey huey they. umr (Raziallahu anhu) ne arz kya : ya Rasulullah ! aap mujhey har cheez se zyada azeez hain, siwa meri apni jaan ke. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke nahi, us zaat ki qism jiske hath mein meri jaan hai. (eman us waqt tak mukammal nahi ho sakta ( jab tak main tumhen tumhari apni jaan se bhi zyada azeez na ho jaun. umr (Raziallahu anhu) ne arz kya : phir Allah ki qism ! ab aap mujhey meri apni jaan se bhi zyada azeez hain. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke haan, umr ! ab tera eman pura hua."
"6633","2 aadmiyon ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki majlis mein apna jhagdaa pesh kya. unmein se aik ne kaha ke hamarey darmyan aap kitabullah ke mutabiq faisla kar dein. doosrey ne, jo zyada samajhdaar tha kaha ke theek hai, ya Rasulullah! hamarey darmyan kitabullah ke mutabiq faisla kar dijiye aur mujhey ijazat dijiye ke us maamle mein kuchh arz karun. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke kaho. un sahib ne kaha ke mera ladka us shakhs ke yahan ( Aseef ( tha. ( Aseef ( , Mina ( الأجير ( ko kehtey hain. ( الأجير (ke mana mazdoor ke hain) aur us ne uski biwi se zina kar liya. unhon-ne mujh se kaha ke ab mere ladkey ko sangsaar kya jaeyga isliye (is se nijat dilaane ke liye) maine so bakriyon aur aik londi ka unhein fidya de diya phir maine doosrey ilm walon se us masla ko puchha to unhon-ne bataya ke mere ladkey ki saza ye hai ke usey so kode lagaey jayen aur aik saal ke liye Shahar badr kar diya jaey, sangsaari ki saza sirf us aurat ko hogi. is par Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke us zaat ki qism jiske hath mein meri jaan hai main tumhara faisla kitabullah ke mutabiq karunga . tumhari bakriyan aur tumhari londi tumhen wapas hogi aur phir aap ne iske ladkey ko so kode lagwaaey aur aik saal ke liye jilaa watan kar diya. phir aap ne Anees Aslami se farmaya ke muddaii ki biwi ko laey aur agar wo zina ka iqrar karey to usey sangsaar kar de. us aurat ne zina ka iqrar kar liya aur sangsaar kar di gaee."
"6634","2 aadmiyon ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki majlis mein apna jhagdaa pesh kya. unmein se aik ne kaha ke hamarey darmyan aap kitabullah ke mutabiq faisla kar dein. doosrey ne, jo zyada samajh daar tha kaha ke theek hai, ya Rasulullah ! hamarey darmyan kitabullah ke mutabiq faisla kar dijiye aur mujhey ijazat dijiye ke is maamle mein kuchh arz karun. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke kaho. un sahib ne kaha ke mera ladka is shakhs ke yahan ( Aseef ( tha. ( Aseef ), Mina ( الأجير ( ko kehtey hain. ( الأجير (ke mana mazdoor ke hain) aur us ne uski biwi se zina kar liya. unhon-ne mujh se kaha ke ab mere ladkey ko sangsaar kya jaeyga isliye (is se nijat dilaane ke liye) maine so bakriyon aur aik londi ka unhein fidya de diya phir maine doosrey ilm walon se is mas'ale ko puchha to unhon-ne bataya ke mere ladkey ki saza ye hai ke usey so kode lagaey jayen aur aik saal ke liye Shahar badr kar diya jaey, sangsaari ki saza sirf us aurat ko hogi. is par Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke us zaat ki qism jiske hath mein meri jaan hai main tumhara faisla kitabullah ke mutabiq karunga . tumhari bakriyan aur tumhari londi tumhen wapas hogi aur phir aap ne iske ladkey ko so kode lagwaaey aur aik saal ke liye jalaa watan kar diya. phir aap ne Anees Aslami se farmaya ke muddaii ki biwi ko laey aur agar wo zina ka iqrar karey to usey sangsaar kar de. us aurat ne zina ka iqrar kar liya aur sangsaar kar di gaee."
"6635","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya '' bhala batlao Aslam, ghifaar, muzena aur juhaina ke qabeeley agar Tameem, Aamir bin sa'sa'a, Ghatfan aur Asad walon se behtar hon to ye Tameem aur Aamir aur Ghatfan aur Asad waley ghaatey mein padey aur nuqsan mein rahe ya nahi. sahaba ne arz kya : ji haan beshak. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne is par phir farmaya ke us zaat ki qism jiske hath mein meri jaan hai (wo pahley jin qabaayel ka zikr hua) un (Tameem wghaira) se behtar hain."
"6636","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne aik aamil (governor) muqarrar kya. aamil apne kaam poorey karke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khidmat mein hazir hua aur arz kya : ya Rasulullah ! ye maal aap ka hai aur ye maal mujhey tohfa diya gaya hai. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke phir tum apne maan-baap ke ghar hi mein kyon nahi baithey rahe aur phir dekhtey ke tumhen koi tohfa deta hai ya nahi. iske baad Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) khutbe ke liye khadey huey, raat ki Namaz ke baad aur kalima shahadat aur Allah Taala ki uski shaan ke mutabiq sana ke baad farmaya ammaa ba'd! aisey aamil ko kya ho gaya hai ke ham usey aamil banatey hain. ( jiziya aur doosrey tax wsool karne ke liye) aur wo phir hamarey paas aa kar kehta hai ke ye to aap ka tax hai aur mujhey tohfa diya gaya hai. phir wo apne maan-baap ke ghar kyon nahi betha aur dekhta ke usey tohfa diya jata hai ya nahi. us zaat ki qism jiske hath mein meri jaan hai, agar tum mein se koi bhi us maal mein se kuchh bhi khayanat karega to qiyamat ke din usey apni gardan par uthaaeyga. agar oont ki us ne khayanat ki hogi to us haal mein lekar aayega ke awaz nikal rahi hogi. agar gaaey ki khayanat ki hogi to us haal mein usey lekar aayega ke gaaey ki awaz aa rahi hogi. agar bakri ki khayanat ki hogi to us haal mein aayega ke bakri ki awaz aa rahi hogi. bas maine tum tak pahuncha diya. abu-Humed (Raziallahu anhu) ne bayan kya ke phir Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne apna hath itni uper uthaya ke ham aap ki baghlon ki safedi dekhney lagey. abu-Humed (Raziallahu anhu) ne bayan kya ke mere sath ye hadis Zaid-bin-Saabit (Raziallahu anhu) ne bhi Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se suni thi, tum log unse bhi poochh lo."
"6637","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''us zaat ki qism ! jiske hath mein meri jaan hai agar tum bhi aakhirat ki wo mushkilaat jantey jo main janta hun to tum zyada rotey aur kam hanstey.''"
"6638","main Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) tak pahuncha to aap Kaba ke saaye mein baithey huey farma rahe they Kaba ke rab ki qism ! wahi sabse zyada khasaarey waley hain. Kaba ke rab ki qism ! wahi sabse zyada khasaarey waley hain. maine kaha ke ya Rasulullah ! meri haalat kaisi hai, kya mujh main ( bhi) koi aisi baat nazar aai hai? meri haalat kaisi hai? phir main Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke paas baith gaya aur Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) farmatey ja rahe they, mein aapko khamosh nahi kara sakta tha aur Allah ki marzi ke mutabiq mujh par ajeeb be-qaraarii taarii ho gaee. maine phir arz ki, mere maan-baap aap par fidaa hon, ya Rasulullah ! wo kon log hain? Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke ye wo log hain jinke paas maal zyada hai. lekin us se wo mustashnaa hain. jinhoney usmein se is-is tarah (yani daaein aur baaein be-daregh mustahiqeen par) Allah ki raah mein kharch kya hoga."
"6639","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya '' Sulaiman (Alaihissalam) ne aik din kaha ke aaj main raat main apni nawwey beeviyon ke paas jaaunga aur har aik ke yahan aik ghud-sawaar bachcha paida hoga jo Allah ke raaste mein jihad karega . is par unke sathi ne kaha ke inshaAllah . lekin Sulaiman (Alaihissalam) ne inshaAllah nahi kaha, chunanche wo apni tamam beeviyon ke paas gaey lekin aik aurat ke siwa kisi ko hamal nahi hua aur us se bhi naaqis bachcha paida hua aur us zaat ki qism jiske hath mein Muhammad ki jaan hai ! agar unhon-ne inshaAllah keh diya hota to ( tamam beeviyon ke yahan bachchey paida hotey (aur sab ghodon par Sawar ho kar Allah ke rastey mein jihad karne waley hotey .''"
"6640","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khidmat mein resham ka aik tukda hadiya ke taur par aaya to log usey dast badast apne hathon mein leney lagey aur uski khoobsoortii aur narmii par hairat karne lagey. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne is par farmaya ke tumhen is par hairat hai? sahaba ne kaha ji haan , ya Rasulullah ! Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke us zaat ki qism jiske hath mein meri jaan hai, Sad (Raziallahu anhu) ke roomaal jannat mein us se bhi achchhey hain. Shoba aur Israel ne Abu-Ishaq se alfaz ''us zaat ki qism jiske hath mein meri jaan hai'' ka zikr nahi kya."
"6641","Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) ne kaha ke Hind binte- Utba-bin- Rabee (Muaawiya (Raziallahu anhu) ki maan ( ne arz kya : ya Rasulullah ! saari zameen par jitney derney waley hain (yani Arab log jo aksar deron aur khemon mein raha kartey they) mein kisi ka zaleel w khuwaar hona mujh ko itna pasand nahi tha jitna aap kaa. Yahya-bin-Bukair rawi ko shak hai ab koi dere wala ya derey waley unko izzat aur aabroo hasil hona mujh ko aap ke derney walon se zyada pasand nahi hai (yani ab main aap ki aur musalmanon ki sabse zyada khair-khaah hun) Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke abhi kya hai to aur bhi zyada khair-khaah banegii. qism hai uski jiske hath mein Muhammad (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki jaan hai. phir Hind kehney lagi ya Rasulullah! Abu-Sufiyan to aik kanjoos aadmi hai mujh par gunah to nahi hoga agar main iske maal mein se (apne baal bachchon ko khilaaun) Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya nahi agar to dastoor ke muwafiq kharch kare."
"6642","aik mauqe par Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) jab yamnii chamdey ke kheme se pusht lagaey huey baithey they, to aap ne apne sahaba se farmaya kya tum is par khush ho ke tum ahle-jannat ke aik chothai raho? unhon-ne arz kya, kyon nahi. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya kya tum is par khush nahi ho ke tum ahle-jannat ke aik tehai hissey paogey sahaba ne arz kya kyon nahi. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne is par farmaya, to us zaat ki qism jiske hath mein meri jaan hai ! mujhey ummeed hai ke jannat mein aadhey tum hi hogey."
"6643","aik sahabi ne suna ke aik doosrey sahabi sura ikhlas baar-baar padhtey hain jab subah hui to wo Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke paas aaey aur Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se iska zikr kya, wo sahabi is sura ko kam samajhtey they lekin Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke us zaat ki qism jiske hath mein meri jaan hai ye Quran Majeed ke aik tehai hisse ke barabar hai."
"6644","unhon-ne Nabi Karim kareem (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se suna, Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) farma rahe they ke rukoo aur sajda poorey taur par ada kya karo. Allah ki qism jiske hath mein meri jaan hai main apni kamar ke peechhey se tum ko dekh leta hun jab rukoo aur sajda kartey ho."
"6645","Ansari khatun Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khidmat mein hazir huin, unke sath unke bachchey bhi they. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne unse farmaya ke us zaat ki qism jiske hath mein meri jaan hai tum log bhi mujhey tamam logon mein sabse zyada azeez ho. ye alfaz Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne teen martaba farmaaey."
"6646","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) umr bin-Khattab (Raziallahu anhu) ke paas aaey to wo sawaaron ki aik jamat ke sath chal rahe they aur apne bap ki qism kha rahe they. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke khabardaar tahqeeq Allah Taala ne tumhen bap daadon ki qism khaney se mana kya hai, jisey qism khaani hai usey chahiye ke Allah hi ki qism khaaey warna chup rahe."
"6647","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne mujh se farmaya tha ke Allah Taala ne tumhen bap daadon ki qism khaney se mana kya hai. umr (Raziallahu anhu) ne bayan kya Allah ki qism ! phir maine unki Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se manaahii sunney ke baad kabhi qism nahi khaaii na apni taraf se ghairullaah ki qism khaaii na kisi doosrey ki zaban se naql ki. Mujahid ne kaha sura ehqaaf mein jo أثرة من علم hai iska mana ye hai ke ilm ki koi baat naql karta ho. Yunus ke sath us hadis ko Aqeel aur Muhammad-bin Waleed Zubaidi aur Ishaq bin Yahya kalbi ne bhi Zohri se riwayat kya aur Sufiyan-bin-Uena aur Mamar ne usko Zohri se riwayat kya, unhon-ne Salim se, unhon-ne ibne-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) se, unhon-ne Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se ke aap ne umr (Raziallahu anhu) ko ghairullaah ki qism khaatey suna. riwayat mein lafz ( اثارة ( ki tafseer ( اثرا ( ki munaasibat se bayan kar di kyonke donon ka maadda (route) aik hi hai."
"6648","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya '' apne bap daadon ki qism na khaao .''"
"6649","qabila jurm aur ash'ar ke darmyan bhai chaara tha. ham abu-Musa Ash-ari (Raziallahu anhu) ki khidmat mein maujood they, to unke liye khana laya gaya. usmein murghi bhi thi. unke paas bani taimillaah ka aik surkh rang ka aadmi bhi maujood tha. ghaaliban wo ghulaamon mein se tha. abu-Musa Ash-ari (Raziallahu anhu) ne usey khaney par bulaya to usne kaha ke maine murghi ko gandagi khaatey dekha to mujhey ghin aai aur phir maine qism kha li ke ab main iska gosht nahi khaaunga. abu-Musa Ash-ari (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha ke khadey ho jao to main tumhen iske barey mein aik hadis sunaun . main Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke paas qabila ash'ar ke chand logon ke sath aaya aur ham ne Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se sawari ka janwar maanga . Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke Allah ki qism main tumhen sawari nahi de sakta aur na mere paas aisa koi janwar hai jo tumhen sawari ke liye de sakoon, phir Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke paas kuchh maale-ghanimat ke oont aaey to Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne puchha ke Ash-ari log kahan hain phir aap ne ham ko panch umda qism ke oont diye janey ka hukm farmaya, jab ham unko lekar chaley to ham ne kaha ye ham ne kya kya Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) to qism kha chukey they ke ham ko sawari nahi dengey aur dar-haqiqat Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke paas us waqt sawari maujood bhi na thi phir aap ne ham ko sawar kara diya. ham ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko aap ki qism se ghaafil kar diya. qism Allah ki ham is harkat ke baad kabhi falaah nahi pa sakengey . to ham aap ki taraf lot kar aaey aur aap se ham ne uper wali tafseel ko arz kya ke ham aap ke paas aaey they taake aap ham ko sawari par Sawar kara dein to aap ne qism kha li thi ke aap ham ko sawar nahi karaaeingey aur dar-haqiqat us waqt aap ke paas sawari maujood bhi na thi. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne ye sab sun kar farmaya ke maine tum ko sawar nahi karaya balke Allah ne tum ko sawar kara diya. Allah ki qism jab main koi qism kha leta hun baad mein us se behtar aur mamla dekhta hun to main wahi karta hun jo behtar hota hai aur us qism ka kaffara ada kar deta hun."
"6650","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''jisne qism khaaii aur kaha ke '' laat w uzzaa ki qism '' to usey phir kalima ( لا إله إلا الله ( keh lena chahiye aur jo shakhs apne sathi se kahey ke aao juwa khelein to usey chahiye ke (iske kaffara mein) sadqa kare."
"6651","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne soney ki aik anguthi banwaai aur Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) usey pahntey they, iska nageena hatheli ke hissey ki taraf rakhtey they. phir logon ne bhi aisi anguthiyan banwaa lein iske baad aik din Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) member par baithey aur apni anguthi utaar di aur farmaya ke main usey pehnta tha aur iska nageena andar ki taraf rakhta tha, phir Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne usey utaar kar phenk diya aur farmaya ke Allah ki qism mein ab usey kabhi nahi pahnoonga. to logon ne bhi apni anguthiyan utaar kar phenk din."
"6652","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''jo Islam ke siwa kisi aur mazhab par qism khaaey to wo aisa hi hai jaise ke usne qism khaaii hai aur jo shakhs apne nafs ko kisi cheez se halaak karey wo dozakh mein usi cheez se azab diya jata rahega aur momin par laanat bhejna usko qatl karne ke barabar hai aur jisne kisi momin par kufr ka ilzam lagaya to wo bhi uske qatl karne ke barabar hai.''"
"6653","unhon-ne Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se suna, Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) farmatey they ke Bani-Israeel mein teen shakhs they Allah ne unko aazmaanaa chaha ( phir Sara qissa bayan kya ( Farishtey ko kodhii ke paas bheja wo us se kehney laga meri rozii ke sarey zariey kat gaey hain ab Allah hi ka aasraa hai phir tera (ya ab Allah hi ki madad darkaar hai phir teri ( phir poori hadis ko zikr kya."
"6654","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne qism khaney waley ko sachcha karne ka hukm farmaayaa."
"6655","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki aik sahibzadi ( Zenab ( ne aapko bula bheja us waqt aap ke paas Usama-bin-Zaid aur Sad-bin-Ubada aur Ubai-bin-Kab (Raziallahu anhu) bhi baithey they. sahibzadi saahiba ne kelha bheja ke unka bachcha marney ke qareeb hai aap tashrif laaiye. aap ne unke jawab mein yun kelha bheja mera salam kaho aur kaho sab Allah ka maal hai jo usney ley liya aur jo usney inayat farmaya aur har cheez ka uske paas waqt muqarrar hai, sabr karo aur Allah se sawab ki ummeed rakho . sahibzadi saahiba ne qism de kar phir kelha bheja ke nahi aap zaroor tashrif laaiye . us waqt aap uthey , ham log bhi sath uthey jab aap sahibzadi saahiba ke ghar par pahunchey aur wahan ja kar baithey to bachchey ko utha kar aap ke paas laey. aap ne usey god mein bitha liya wo dam tod raha tha. ye ranj bhara haal dekh kar aap ki aankhon se aansu bah nikley. Sad-bin-Ubada (Raziallahu anhu) ne arz kya : ya Rasulullah ! ye ronaa kaisa hai? Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke ye ronaa raham ki wjah se hai aur Allah apne jis bandey ke dil mein chahta hai raham rakhta hai ya ye hai ke Allah apne un hi bandon par raham karega jo dusron par raham kartey hain."
"6656","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''jis musalman ke teen bachchey mar jayen to usko dozakh ki aag nahi chhueygii magar sirf qism utaarney ke liye. ''"
"6657","maine Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se suna, Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) farmatey they ke main tum ko bataun jannati kon log hain, har aik ghareeb kamzor jo agar Allah ke bharosey par qism kha baithey to Allah usko sachcha karey ( uski qism poori kar de) aur dozakhi kon log hain har aik motaa, ladaakaa, maghroor aur fasaadii."
"6658","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se puchha gaya ke kon log achchhey hain. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke mera zamana , phir wo log jo us se qareeb hongey phir wo log jo us se qareeb hongey. iske baad aik aisi qaum paida hogi jiski gawahi qism se pahley zaban par aa jaya karegi aur qism gawahi se pahley . Ibrahim ne kaha ke hamarey asaatza jab ham kam Umr they, to hamein qism khaney se mana kya kartey they ke ham gawahi ya ahad mein qism khaaein ."
"6659","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''jisne jhooti qism is maqsad se khaaii ke kisi musalman ka maal iske zariey naajaaiz tareeqey par hasil karey to wo Allah Taala se is haal mein milega ke wo is par ghazab naak hoga. phir Allah Taala ne uski tasdeeq nazil ki) Quran Majeed mein ke) ( إن الذين يشترون بعهد الله‏ ( bila shubah wo log jo Allah ke ahad ke zariey khareedtey hain.''"
"6660","phir Ashas bin Qais (Raziallahu anhu) wahan se guzrey aur puchha ke Abdullah tum se kya bayan kar rahe they. ham ne unse bayan kya to Ashas (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha ke ye aayat mere aur mere aik sathi ke barey mein nazil hui thi, aik kuwein ke silsiley mein ham donon ka jhagdaa tha."
"6661","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''jahannam barabar yahi kehti rahegi ke kya kuchh aur hai kya kuchh aur hai? aakhir Allah tabarak w taala apna qadam usmein rakh dega to wo keh uthegi bas bas mein bhar gaee, teri izzat ki qasam! aur iska kuchh hissey kuchh ko khaney lagega.'' us riwayat ko Shoba ne Qatada se naql kya."
"6861","aik sahib yani khud aap ne kaha : ya Rasulullah ! Allah ke nazdeek kon sa gunah sabse bada hai? Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ye ke tum Allah ka kisi ko Sharik thehrao jabke us ne tumhen paida kya hai. puchha : phir kon sa ? Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke phir ye ke tum apne ladkey ko us dar se mar dalo ke wo tumharey sath khana khaaeyga. puchha : phir kon sa? farmaya phir ye ke tum apne padosi ki biwi se zina karo. phir Allah Taala ne uski tasdeeq mein ye aayat nazil ki والذين لا يدعون مع الله إلها آخر wla يقتلون النفس التي حرم الله إلا بالحق wla يزنون ومن يفعل ذلك يلق أثاما يضاعف له العذاب''aur wo log jo Allah ke sath kisi doosrey maabood ko nahi pukaartey aur na kisi aisey insan ki nahaq jaan letey hain jisey Allah ne haram kya aur na zina kartey hain aur jo koi aisa karega .'' aakhir aayat tak."
"6862","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''momin us waqt tak apne Deen ke barey mein barabar kushaada rehta hai) usey har waqt maghfirat ki ummeed rehti hai) jab tak nahaq khoon na karey jahan nahaq kya to maghfirat ka darwaza tang ho jata hai.''"
"6863","halaakat ka bhanwar jis mein girney ke baad phir nikalney ki ummeed nahi hai wo nahaq khoon karna hai, jis ko Allah Taala ne haram kya hai."
"6864","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''sabse pahley (qiyamat ke din) logon ke darmyan khoon kharaabey ke faisley kiye jaengey. ''"
"6866","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne Miqdad (Raziallahu anhu) se farmaya tha ke agar koi musalman kaafiron ke sath rehta ho phir wo dar ke maarey apna eman chhipata ho, agar wo apna eman zahir kar de aur to usko mar daley ye kyon kar durust hoga khud tum bhi to Makka mein pahley apna eman chhipaatey they."
"6867","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''jo jaan nahaq qatl ki jaey iske ( gunah ka ( aik hissey Adam (Alaihissalam) ke pahley betey (Qaabeel par) padta hai.''"
"6868","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''mere baad kaafir na bin jana ke tum mein se kuchh kuchh ki gardan maarney lag jaao.''"
"6869","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne Hijjatul-wada ke din farmaya '' logon ko khamosh kara do, ( phir farmaya ( tum mere baad kaafir na bin jana ke tum mein se koi kisii ki gardan maarney lagey.'' us hadis ki riwayat Abu-Bakar aur Ibne-Abbas (Raziallahu anhu) ne Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se ki hai."
"6870","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya '' kabeera gunah Allah ke sath kisi ko Sharik thehrana , waalidain ki nafarmani karna ya farmaya ke nahaq doosrey ka maal leney ke liye jhooti qism khana hain.'' shak Shoba ko tha aur Muaz ne bayan kya, unse Shoba ne bayan kya, kaha kabeera gunah Allah ke sath kisi ko Sharik thehrana , kisi ka maal nahaq leney ke liye jhooti qism khana aur waalidain ki nafarmani karna ya kaha ke kisi ki jaan lenaa."
"6871","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya '' gunah kabeera '' aur ham se Amr ne bayan kya, kaha ham se Shoba ne bayan kya, unse Abu-Bakar ne aur unse Anas-bin-Malik (Raziallahu anhu) ne bayan kya ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''sabse badey gunah Allah ke sath kisi ko Sharik thehrana , kisi ki nahaq jaan lena , waalidain ki nafarmani karna aur jhoot bolnaa hain ya farmaya ke jhooti gawahi dena."
"6872","hamein Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne qabila juhaina ki aik shaakh ki taraf ( muhim par) bhejaa. bayan kya ke phir ham ne un logon ko subah ke waqt ja liya aur unhein shikast de di. rawi ne bayan kya ke main aur qabila Ansar ke aik sahib qabila juhaina ke aik shakhs tak pahunchey aur jab ham ne usey gher liya to usne kaha ( لا إله إلا الله ( Ansari sahabi ne to (ye suntey hi ( hath rok liya lekin maine apne neze se usey qatl kar diya. rawi ne bayan kya ke jab ham wapas aaey to is waaqie ki khabar Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko mili . bayan kya ke phir Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne mujh se farmaya '' Usama ! kya tum ne kalima ( لا إله إلا الله (ka iqrar karne ke baad usey qatl kar dala. '' maine arz kya : ya Rasulullah ! us ne sirf jaan bachaney ke liye iska iqrar kya tha. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne phir farmaya ''tum ne usey ( لا إله إلا الله (ka iqrar karne ke baad qatl kar dala. '' bayan kya ke Nabi Karim us jumla ko itni baar dohraatey rahe ke mere dil mein ye khahish paida ho gaee ke kash! main is se pahley musalman na hua hota."
"6873","main un naqeebon mein se tha jinhoney ( Mina mein Lailatal-Aqbaa ke mauqe par) Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se bait ki thi. ham ne iski bait (ahad ( ki thi ke ham Allah ke sath kisi ko Sharik nahi thahraaeingey, ham chori nahi karengey, zina nahi karengey, kisi ki nahaq jaan nahi lengey jo Allah ne haram ki hai, ham loot-maar nahi karengey aur Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki nafarmani nahi karengey aur ye ke agar ham ne is par amal kya to hamein jannat milegii aur agar ham ne unmein se kisi tarah ka gunah kya to uska faisla Allah tabarak w taala ke yahan hoga."
"6874","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''jisne ham par hathiyar uthaya wo ham mein se nahi hai.''abu-Moosa (Raziallahu anhu) ne bhi Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se ye hadis riwayat ki hai."
"6875","main un sahib ( Ali-bin abi-Talib (Raziallahu anhu)) ki jange-jamal mein madad ke liye taiyaar tha ke Abu-Bakra (Raziallahu anhu) se meri mulaqat hui. unhon-ne poochha, kahan ka irada hai? maine kaha ke un sahib ki madad ke liye jana chahta hun. unhon-ne farmaya ke wapas chaley jao maine Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se suna hai Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) farmatey they ke jab 2 musalman talwaar kheench kar aik doosrey se bhid jayen to qaatil aur maqtool donon dozakh mein jatey hain. maine arz kya : ya Rasulullah ! aik to qaatil tha lekin maqtool ko saza kyon milegii ? Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke wo bhi apne qaatil ke qatl par aamada tha."
"6876","aik Yahudi ne aik ladki ka sar 2 pattharon ke darmyan rakh kar kuchal diya phir us ladki se puchha gaya ke ye kis ne kya hai? falan ne, falan ne? aakhir jab us Yahudi ka naam liya gaya (to ladki ne sar ke ishara se haan kaha ( phir Yahudi ko Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke yahan laya gaya aur us se poochh gachh ki jati rahi yahan tak ke usne jurm ka iqrar kar liya chunanche uskaa sar bhi pattharon se kuchlaa gaya."
"6877","Madina Munawra mein aik ladki chandi ke zewar pahney bahar niklii. rawi ne bayan kya ke phir usey aik Yahudi ne patthar se mar diya. jab usey Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke paas laya gaya to abhi usmein jaan baqi thi. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne puchha tumhen falan ne maara hai? is par ladki ne apna sar ( inkar ke liye) uthaya , phir Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne puchha tumhen falan ne maara hai? ladki ne is par bhi uthaya . teesri martaba Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne poochha, falan ne tumhen maara hai? is par ladki ne apna sar nichey ki taraf jhukaa liya ( iqrar kartey huey jhukaa liya ( chunanche Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne us shakhs ko bulaya tab Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne 2 pattharon se kuchal kar usey qatl karaya."
"6878","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''kisi musalman ka khoon jo kalima la ilaaha-illallaah Muhammadur-rasoolullaah ka manney wala ho halal nahi hai albatta teen Suraton mein jaaiz hai. jaan ke badle jaan leney waalaa, shadi shuda ho kar zina karne wala aur Islam se nikal janey wala ( murtad ( jamat ko chhod dene wala. ''"
"6879","aik Yahudi ne aik ladki ko iske chandi ke zewar ke laalach mein mar daala tha. us ne ladki ko patthar se maara phir ladki Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke paas laai gaee to uske jism mein jaan baqi thi. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne puchha kya tumhen falan ne maara hai? us ne sar ke ishara se inkar kya. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne dobara poochha, kya tumhen falan ne maara hai? us martaba bhi us ne sar ke ishaarey se inkar kya. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne jab teesri martaba puchha to usne sar ke ishara se iqrar kya. chunanche Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne Yahudi ko 2 pattharon mein kuchal kar qatl kar diya."
"6880","qabila khuza'aa ke logon ne aik aadmi ko qatl kar diya tha aur Abdullah-bin -Rijaa ne kaha, unse Harab bin Shaddad ne, unse Yahya-bin-abi-Kasir ne, unse abu-Salma-bin-Abdur-Rehman ne bayan kya aur unse Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) ne bayan kya ke fateh Makka ke mauqe par qabila khuza'aa ne bani Leis ke aik shakhs ko apne jahiliyat ke maqtool ke badle mein qatl kar diya tha. is par Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) khadey huey aur farmaya ''Allah taala ne Makka Mukarrama se haathiyon ke (shaah Yaman Abraha ke) lashkar ko rok diya tha lekin us ne apne rasool aur mominon ko is par ghalba diya. haan ye mujh se pahley kisi ke liye halal nahi hua tha aur na mere baad kisi ke liye halal hoga aur mere liye bhi din ko sirf ghadi bhar ke liye. ab is waqt se iski hurmat phir qaaim ho gaee. ( sun lo ( iska kaantaa na ukhaadaa jaey, iska darakht na taraashaa jaey aur siwa iske jo elaan karne ka irada rakhta hai koi bhi yahan ki giri hui cheez na uthaey aur dekho jiska koi azeez qatl kar diya jaey to usey 2 baton mein ikhtiyar hai ya usey uska khoon baha diya jaey ya qisaas diya jaey. ye waz (nasihat) sun kar is par aik yamnii sahib Abu-Shah naam ke khadey huey aur kaha : ya Rasulullah ! is waz (nasihat) ko mere liye likhwaa dijiye. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ye waz (nasihat) Abu-Shah ke liye likh do. iske baad Quraish ke aik sahib Abbas (Raziallahu anhu) khadey huey aur kaha : ya Rasulullah izkhir ghaas ki ijazat farma dijiye kyonke ham usey apne gharon main aur apni qabron mein bichhaatey hain. chunanche Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne izkhir ghaas ukhaadney ki ijazat de di aur is riwayat ki mutabiat (pairavi) Ubaidullah ne Sheban ke waaste se haathiyon ke waaqie ke zikr ke silsile mein ki. kuchh ne abu-Nueim ke hawale se ( القتل‏ . Mina (ka lafz riwayat ka hai aur Ubaidullah ne bayan kya ke ya maqtool ke ghar walon ko qisaas diya jaey."
"6881","Bani-Israeel mein sirf qisaas ka riwaaj tha, diyat ki sura nahi thi. phir is ummat ke liye ye hukm nazil hua ( كتب عليكم القصاص في القتلى‏ ( الخ . Ibne-Abbas ne kaha ( فمن عفي له من أخيه شىء‏ ( se yahi murad hai ke maqtool ke waaris jan-boojhkar qatl karney mein diyat par razi ho jayen aur) فاتباع بالمعروف‏ ( se ye murad hai ke maqtool ke waaris dastoor ke muwafiq qaatil se diyat ka taqaza karein ( وآداء اليه باحسان ( se ye murad hai ke qaatil achi tarah khush dillii se diyat ada kare."
"6882","Allah Taala ke nazdeek logon ( musalmanon ( mein sabse zyada mabghooz (jinpar ghussa bhadakta hai) teen tarah ke log hain. haram mein zyadti karne waalaa, doosra jo Islam mein jahiliyat ki rasmon par chalney ka khaahishmand ho, teesrey wo shakhs jo kisi aadmi ka nahaq khoon karne ke liye iske peechhey lagey."
"6883","mushrekeen ne Uhud ki ladai mein pahley shikast khaaii thi (doosri sanad) imam Bukhari (Rahmatullahi-alaih) ne kaha mujh se Muhammad-bin Harab ne bayan kya, unse Abu-Marwaan Yahya ibne-abi Zakariya ne bayan kya, unse Hisham ne, unse Urwa ne aur unse Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) ne bayan kya ke iblees Uhud ki ladai mein logon mein cheekhaa . aey Allah ke bando! apne peechhey walon se, magar ye suntey hi aagey ke musalman peechhey ki taraf palat padey yahan tak ke musalmanon ne ( ghalati mein) Huzefa ke walid Yamaan (Raziallahu anhu) ko qatl kar diya. is par Huzefa (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha ke ye mere walid hain, mere walid ! lekin unhein qatl hi kar dala. phir Huzefa (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha Allah tumhari maghfirat kare. bayan kya ke mushrekeen ki aik jamat maidan se bhag kar Taaif tak pahunch gaee thi."
"6884","aik Yahudi ne aik ladki ka sar 2 pattharon ke darmyan mein lekar kuchal diya tha. us ladki se puchha gaya ke ye tumharey sath kis ne kiya? kya falan ne kya hai? kya falan ne kya hai? aakhir jab us Yahudi ka naam liya gaya to usne apne sar ke ishaarey se ( haan ( kaha phir Yahudi laya gaya aur us ne iqrar kar liya chunanche Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke hukm se iska bhi sar patthar se kuchal diya gaya. Hammam ne 2 pattharon ka zikr kya hai."
"6885","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne aik Yahudi ko aik ladki ke badle mein qatl kara diya tha, Yahudi ne us ladki ko chandi ke zewaraat ke laalach mein qatl kar diya tha."
"6886","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke munh main ( maut ke marz ke mauqe par) aap ki marzii ke khilaf ham ne dawaa dali . Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke mere halaq mein dawaa na dalo lekin ham ne samjha ke mareez honey ki wjah se dawaa peeney se nafrat kar rahe hain lekin jab aapko hosh hua to farmaya ke tum jitney log ghar mein ho sab ke halaq mein zabardastii dawaa dali jaey siwa Abbas (Raziallahu anhu) ke ke wo us waqt maujood nahi they."
"6888","(riwaayat hai ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ( agar koi shakhs terey ghar main ( kisi suraakh ya jangley wghaira se) tum se ijazat liye baghair jhank raha ho aur tum usey kankari maaro jis se uski aankh phoot jaey to tum par koi saza nahi hai na gunah hoga na duniya ki koi saza laagu hogi."
"6889","aik sahib Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke ghar mein jhank rahe they, to Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne unki taraf teer ka phal badhaya tha. maine puchha ke ye hadis tum se kis ne bayan ki hai? to unhon-ne bayan kya Anas-bin-Malik (Raziallahu anhu) ne."
"6890","Uhud ki ladai mein mushrekeen ko pahley shikast ho gaee thi lekin iblees ne chilla kar kaha aey Allah ke bando! peechhey ki taraf walon se bacho ! chunanche aagey ke log palat padey aur aagey waley peechhey walon se (jo musalman hi they) bhid gaey. achcha Huzefa (Raziallahu anhu) ne dekha to unke walid Yamaan (Raziallahu anhu) they. Huzefa (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha : Allah ke bando! ye to mere walid hain, mere walid . bayan kya ke Allah ki qism musalman unhein qatl karke hi hatey . is par Huzefa (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha Allah tumhari maghfirat kare. Urwa ne bayan kya ke is waaqie ka sadma Huzefa (Raziallahu anhu) ko aakhir waqt tak raha."
"6891","ham Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke sath khaibar ki taraf nikley. jamat ke aik sahib ne kaha aamir! hamein apni hadii (oont ko tez hankaaney ka geet) sunaaiye . unhon-ne hadi padhni shuru ki to Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne puchha ke kon sahib ga ga kar oonton ko haank rahe hain? logon ne kaha ke Aamir hain. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya, Allah un par raham kare. sahaba ne arz kya : ya Rasulullah ! aap ne hamein Aamir se fayda kyon nahi uthaney diya. chunanche Aamir (Raziallahu anhu) usi raat ko apni hi talwaar se Shahid ho gaey. logon ne kaha ke unke aamaal barbad ho gaey, unhon-ne khudkushii kar li (kyonke aik Yahudi par hamla kartey waqt khud apni talwaar se zakhmi ho gaey they) jab main wapas aaya aur maine dekha ke log aapas mein keh rahe hain ke Aamir ke aamaal barbad ho gaey to main Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khidmat mein hazir hua aur arz kya : aey Allah ke Nabi ! aap par mere bap aur maan fidaa hon, ye log kehtey hain ke Aamir ke sarey aamaal barbad huey. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke jo shakhs ye kehta hai ghalat kehta hai. Aamir ko dohra ajr milega wo ( Allah ke raaste mein) mashaqqat uthaney waley aur jihad karne waley they aur kis qatl ka ajr us se badh kar hoga?"
"6892","aik shakhs ne aik shakhs ke hath mein daant se kaataa to usne apna hath kaatney waley ke munh mein se kheench liya jis se uske aagey ke 2 daant toot gaey phir donon apna jhagdaa Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke paas laey to Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke tum apne hi bhai ko is tarah daant se kat-tey ho jaisey oont kaat'taa hai tumhen diyat nahi milegii."
"6893","mein aik jang mein bahar tha aur aik shakhs ne daant se kaat liya tha jiski wjah se iske aagey ke daant toot gaey they phir Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne us muqaddima ko baatil qarar de kar uski diyat nahi dilai ."
"6894","Nazar ki beti ne aik ladki ko tamaancha maara tha aur uske daant toot gaey they. log Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke paas muqaddima laey to Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne qisaas ka hukm diya."
"6895","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''ye aur ye barabar yani chhanguliyaa aur angoothaa diyat mein barabar hain.''"
"6896","aik ladkey Aseel naam ke ko dhokey se qatl kar diya gaya tha. umr (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha ke sarey ahal san'aa ( Yaman ke log ( iske qatl mein Sharik hotey to main sab ko qatl kara deta aur Mughira bin-Hakim ne apne walid se bayan kya ke char aadmiyon ne aik bachchey ko qatl kar diya tha to umr (Raziallahu anhu) ne ye baat farmai thi Abu-Bakar , ibne-Zubair , Ali aur Suwed bin Muqrin (Raziallahu anhu) ne chaantey ka badla dilwaayaa tha aur umr (Raziallahu anhu) ne durrey ki jo mar aik shakhs ko hui thi iska badla leney ke liye farmaya aur Ali (Raziallahu anhu) ne teen kodon ka qisaas leney ka hukm diya aur Shureh ne kode aur kharaash lagaaney ki saza di thi."
"6897","Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) ne kaha, ham ne Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke marz mein aap ke munh mein zabardastii dawaa dali . halanke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ishara kartey rahe ke dawaa na dali jaey lekin ham ne samjha ke mareez ko dawaa se jo nafrat hoti hai) uski wjah se Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) farma rahe hain) phir jab aapko fayda hua to farmaya, maine tumhen nahi kaha tha ke dawaa na dalo . bayan kya ke ham ne arz kya ke aap ne dawaa se na-gawari ki wjah se aisa kya hoga? is par Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke tum mein se har aik ke munh mein dawaa dali jaey aur main dekhta rahunga siwaey Abbas ke kyonke wo us waqt wahan maujood hi na they."
"6898","unki qaum ke kuchh log khaibar gaey aur (apne apney kaamon ke liye) mukhtalif jaghon mein alag alag gaey phir apne mein ke aik shakhs ko maqtool paya. jinhein wo maqtool miley they, unse un logon ne kaha ke hamarey sathi ko tum ne qatl kya hai. unhon-ne kaha ke na ham ne qatl kya aur na hamein qaatil ka pata malum hai? phir ye log Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke paas gaey aur kaha : ya Rasulullah ! ham khaibar gaey aur phir ham ne wahan apne aik sathi ko maqtool paya. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke tum mein jo bada hai wo baat kare. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke qaatil ke khilaf gawahi laao. unhon-ne kaha ke hamarey paas koi gawahi nahi hai. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke phir ye ( Yahudi ( qism khaaengey (aur unki qism par faisla hoga ( unhon-ne kaha ke yahudiyon ki qasmon ka koi eitibaar nahi. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne usey pasand nahi farmaya ke maqtool ka khoon rayegaan jaey chunanche aap ne sadqe ke oonton mein se so oont ( khud hi ( diyat mein diye."
"6899","Umar-bin Abdul-Azeez ne aik din darbar aam kya aur sab ko ijazat di. log dakhil huey to unhon-ne puchha : qasaama ke barey main tumhara kya khayal hai? kisi ne kaha ke qasaama ke zariey qisaas lena haq hai aur khulafaa ne iske zariey qisaas liya hai. is par unhon-ne mujh se puchha : abu-Qilaba ! tumhari kya raey hai? aur mujhey Awam ke sath la khada kar diya. maine arz kya : ya ameerul-momineen ! aap ke paas Arab ke sardaar aur sharif log rahtey hain aap ki kya raey hogi agar unmein se pachaas aadmi kisi Dimashqi ke shadi shuda shakhs ke barey mein zina ki gawahi dein jabke un logon ne us shakhs ko dekha bhi na ho kya aap unki gawahi par us shakhs ko rajm (sangsaar) kar dengey. ameerul-momineen ne farmaya ke nahi. phir maine kaha ke aap ka kya khayal hai agar unhein ( ashraaf arab) mein se pachaas afraad teiswin ke kisi shakhs ke mutaalliq chori ki gawahi de dein usko baghair dekhey to kya aap uska hath kaat dengey ? farmaya ke nahi. phir maine kaha, to Allah ki qism ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne kabhi kisi ko teen haalaton ke siwa qatl nahi karaya. aik wo shakhs jisne kisi ko zulm kartey huey qatl kya ho aur uske badley mein qatl kya gaya ho. doosra wo shakhs jisne shadi ke baad zina kya ho. tesraa wo shakhs jisne Allah aur uske rasool se jang ki ho aur Islam se phir gaya ho. logon ne is par kaha, kya Anas-bin-Malik (Raziallahu anhu) ne ye hadis nahi bayan ki hai ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne chori ke maamle mein hath pair kaat diye they aur aankhon mein silai phirwaaii thi aur phir unhein dhoop mein dalwaa diya tha. maine kaha ke main aap logon ko Anas-bin-Malik (Raziallahu anhu) ki hadis sunata hun mujh se Anas (Raziallahu anhu) ne bayan kya ke qabila ukul ke aath (8) afraad Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke paas aaey aur aap se Islam par bait ki, phir Madina Munawra ki aab w hua unhein na-muwaafiq hui aur wo bimar pad gaey to unhon-ne Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se uski shikayat ki. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne unse farmaya ke phir kyon nahi tum hamarey charwaahey ke sath iske oonton mein chaley jatey aur oonton ka doodh aur unka peshab peetey . unhon-ne arz kya kyon nahi. chunanche wo nikal gaey aur oonton ka doodh aur peshab piyaa aur sihat mand ho gaey. phir unhon-ne Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke charwaahey ko qatl kar diya aur oont hankaa ley gaey. iski itlaa jab Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko pahunchi to aap ne unki talash mein aadmi bhejey, phir wo pakdey gaey aur laey gaey. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne hukm diya aur unke bhi hath aur paon kaat diye gaey aur unki aankhon mein silai pher di gaee phir unhein dhoop mein dalwaa diya aur aakhir wo mar gaey. maine kaha ke unke amal se badh kar aur kya jurm ho sakta hai Islam se phir gaey aur qatl kya aur chori ki. Anba-bin-Saeed ne kaha maine aaj jaisi baat kabhi nahi suni thi. maine kaha : Anba! kya tum meri hadis radd kartey ho? unhon-ne kaha ke nahi aap ne ye hadis waqia ke mutabiq bayan kar di hai. Allah ki qism ! ahal Sham (Syria) ke sath us waqt tak khair w bhalai rahegi jab tak ye Shekh ( abu-Qilaba ( unmein maujood raheingey. maine kaha ke us qasaama ke silsile main Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki aik sunnat hai. Ansar ke kuchh log aap ke paas aaey aur Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se baat ki phir unmein se aik sahib unke samney hi nikley ( khaibar ke irada se) aur wahan qatl kar diye gaey. iske baad doosrey sahaba bhi gaey aur dekha ke unke sath khoon mein tadap rahe hain. un logon ne wapas aa kar Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko uski itlaa di aur kaha : ya Rasulullah ! hamarey sath guftgu kar rahe they aur achcha wo hamein ( khaibar mein) khoon mein tadaptey miley. phir Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) nikley aur puchha ke tumhara kis par shuba hai ke unhon-ne unko qatl kya hai. sahaba ne kaha ke ham samajhtey hain ke yahudiyon ne hi qatl kya hai phir aap ne yahudiyon ko bula bheja aur unse puchha kya tum ne unhein qatl kya hai? unhon-ne inkar kar diya to aap ne farmaya, kya tum maan jaogey agar pachaas Yahudi iski qism lein ke unhon-ne maqtool ko qatl nahi kya hai. sahaba ne arz kya : ye log zara bhi parwah nahi karengey ke ham sab ko qatl karne ke baad phir qism kha lein (ke qatl unhon-ne nahi kya hai) Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya to phir tum mein se pachaas aadmi qism kha lein aur khoon baha ke mustahiq ho jaaein. sahaba ne arz kya : ham bhi qism khaney ke liye taiyaar nahi hain. chunanche Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne unhein apne paas se khoon baha diya ( abu-Qilaba ne kaha ke) maine kaha ke zamane jahiliyat mein qabila huzail ke logon ne apne aik aadmi ko apne mein se nikal diya tha phir wo shakhs Batha mein Yaman ke aik shakhs ke ghar raat ko aaya. itney mein unmein se koi shakhs bedaar ho gaya aur us ne is par talwaar se hamla karke qatl kar diya. iske baad huzail ke log aaey aur unhon-ne yamnii ko) jisne qatl kya tha) pakda aur umr (Raziallahu anhu) ke paas le gaey Haj ke zamane mein aur kaha ke usne hamarey aadmi ko qatl kar diya hai. yamnii ne kaha ke unhon-ne usey apni braadrii se nikal diya tha. umr (Raziallahu anhu) ne farmaya ke ab huzail ke pachaas aadmi uski qism khaaein ke unhon-ne usey nikala nahi tha. bayan kya ke phir unmein se 49 aadmiyon ne qism khaaii phir unhein ke qabeele ka aik shakhs Sham (Syria) se aaya to unhon-ne us se bhi mutalba kya ke wo qism khaaey lekin us ne apni qism ke badle mein aik hazaar dirham de kar apna peechhaa qism se chhudaa liya. hazliyon ne uski jagah aik doosrey aadmi ko taiyaar kar liya phir wo maqtool ke bhai ke paas gaya aur apna hath iske hath se milaayaa. unhon-ne bayan kya ke phir ham pachaas jinhoney qism khaaii thi rawaana huey. jab maqam nakhla par pahunchey to barish ne unhein aaya. sab log pahaad ke aik ghaar mein ghus gaey aur ghaar un pachaason ke uper gir padaa. jinhoney qism khaaii thi aur sab ke sab mar gaey. albatta donon hath milaaney waley bach gaey. lekin unke peechhey se aik patthar ludhak kar gira aur us se maqtool ke bhai ki taang toot gaee iske baad wo aik saal aur zinda raha phir mar gaya. maine kaha ke Abdul-Malik bin Marwan ne qasaama par aik shakhs se qisaas li thi phir usey apne kiye huey par nadaamat hui aur us ne un pachaason ke mutaalliq jinhoney qism khaaii thi hukm diya aur unke naam rajister se kaat diye gaey phir unhon-ne Sham (Syria) bhej diya."
"6900","aik aadmi Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke aik hujre mein jhaankney laga to Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) teer ka phal lekar uthey aur chahtey they ke ghafalat mein usko mar dein."
"6901","aik aadmi Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke darwaze ke aik suraakh se andar jhaankney laga. us waqt Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke paas lohey ka kangha tha jis se aap sar jhaad rahe they. jab aap ne usey dekha to farmaya ke agar mujhey malum hota ke tum mera intizar kar rahe ho to main usey tumhari aankh mein chubho detaa. phir Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke (ghar ke andar aaney ka ( izn leney ka hukm diya gaya hai wo isi liye to hai ke nazar na padey."
"6902","abul-Qaasim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''agar koi shakhs tumhari ijazat ke baghair tumhen (jab ke tum ghar ke andar ho ( jhank kar dekhey aur tum usey kankari mar do jis se uski aankh phoot jaey to tum par koi gunah nahi hai.''"
"6903","maine Ali (Raziallahu anhu) se poochha, kya aap ke paas koi aisi cheez bhi hai jo Quran Majeed mein nahi hai aur aik martaba unhon-ne is tarah bayan kya ke jo logon ke paas nahi hai. is par unhon-ne kaha ke us zaat ki qism jisne daney se kaunpal ko phaad kar nikala hai aur makhlooq ko paida kya. hamarey paas Quran Majeed ke siwa aur kuchh nahi hai. siwa us samajh ke jo kisi shakhs ko uski kitab mein di jaey aur jo kuchh us saheefe mein hai. maine puchha saheefe mein kya hai? farmaya khoon baha ( diyat ( se mutaalliq ehkaam aur qaidi ke chhudaaney ka hukm aur ye ke koi musalman kisi kaafir ke badle mein qatl nahi kya jaeyga"
"6904","qabila huzail ki 2 aurton ne aik dusri ko (patthar se) maara jis se aik ke pet ka bachcha (janeen) gir gaya phir is ( silsile ( mein Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne usey aik ghulam ya kaneez dene ka faisla kya."
"6906","jab Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne iska faisla kya tha to wo maujood they."
"6908","is par apna koi gawah laao. chunanche Muhammad-bin-Muslima (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha ke main gawahi deta hun ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne ye faisla kya tha."
"6909","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne bani Lahyaan ki aik aurat ke janeen (ke girney) par aik ghulam ya kaneez ka faisla kya tha. phir wo aurat jiske mutaalliq Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne diyat dene ka faisla kya tha uska intiqal ho gaya to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne faisla kya ke uski meeraas uske ladkon aur uske shauhar ko milegii aur diyat iske dadhiyaal walon ko deeni hogi."
"6910","banii-Huzail ki 2 auratein aapas mein ladiin aur aik ne dusri aurat par patthar phenk maara jis se wo aurat apne pet ke bachchey (janeen) samet mar gaee. phir ( maqtoola ke rishtedar ( muqaddima Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke darbar mein ley gaey. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne faisla kya ke pet ke bachchey ka khoon baha aik ghulam ya kaneez deeni hogi aur aurat ke khoon baha ko qaatil aurat ke aaqila ( aurat ke bap ki taraf se rishtedar usba (ke zimma wajib qarar diya."
"6911","jab Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) Madina tashrif laey to Talha (Raziallahu anhu) mera hath pakad kar Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke paas laey aur kaha : ya Rasulullah ! Anas samajh daar ladka hai aur ye aap ki khidmat karega . Anas (Raziallahu anhu) ne bayan kya ke phir maine Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khidmat safar mein bhi ki aur ghar par bhii. Allah ki qism ! Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne kabhi mujh se kisi cheez ke mutaalliq jo maine kar diya ho ye nahi farmaya ke ye kaam tum ne is tarah kyon kya aur na kisi aisi cheez ke mutaalliq jisey maine na kya ho aap ne ye nahi farmaya ke ye kaam tum ne is tarah kyon nahi kya."
"6912","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''chaupaaey agar kisi ko zakhmi kar dein to unka khoon baha nahi, kuwein mein girney ka koi khoon baha nahi, kaan mein dabney ka koi khoon baha nahi aur dafeeney mein panchwan hissey hai.''"
"6913","unhon-ne Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se, Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''be-zabaan janwar kisi ko zakhmi karey to uski diyat kuchh nahi hai, isi tarah kaan mein kaam karne se koi nuqsan pahunchey, isi tarah kuwein mein kaam karne se aur jo kaafiron ka maal dafn kya hua miley usmein panchwan hissey sarkaar mein liya jaaeyga.''"
"6914","unhon-ne Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se, Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''jo shakhs aisi jaan ko mar daley jis se ahad kar chuka ho ( uski aman de chuka ho ( jaisey zimmii , kaafir ko to wo jannat ki khushbu bhi na soonghey ga (usmein dakhil hona to bahut door) halanke jannat ki khushbu chalis (40) baras ki raah se malum hoti hai.''"
"6915","maine abu-Juhaifa se suna, unhon-ne kaha maine Ali (Raziallahu anhu) se puchha kya aap ke paas aur bhi kuchh aayatein ya soortein hain jo is Quran mein nahi hain (yani mashhoor musahaf mein) aur kabhi Sufiyan-bin-Uena ne yun kaha ke jo aam logon ke paas nahi hain. Ali (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha qism us Allah ki jisne daana cheer kar ugaayaa aur jaan ko paida kya hamarey paas us Quran ke siwa aur kuchh nahi hai. albatta aik samajh hai jo Allah Taala apni kitab ki jis ko chahta hai inayat farmata hai aur wo jo us waraq pe likha hua hai. abu-Juhaifa ne kaha us waraq pe kya likha hai? unhon-ne kaha diyat aur qaidi chhudaaney ke ehkaam aur ye masla ke musalman kaafir ke badley qatl na kya jaey."
"6916","unhon-ne Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya '' dekho aur paighambaron se mujh ko fazeelat mat do. ''"
"6917","yahood mein se aik shakhs Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke paas aaya, usko kisi ne tamaancha lagaya tha. kehney laga : aey Muhammad ! (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) tumharey ashaab mein se aik Ansari shakhs ne mujh ko tamaancha maara . aap ne logon se farmaya usko bulao to unhon-ne bulaya (wo hazir hua) aap ne puchha tu ney iske munh par tamaancha kyon maara . wo kehney laga : ya Rasulullah ! aisa hua ke main yahudiyon ke paas se guzra , maine suna ye Yahudi yun qism kha raha tha qism us parwardigar ki jisne Musa (Alaihissalam) ko sarey aadmiyon mein se chun liya. maine kaha kya Muhammad (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se bhi wo afzal hain? aur us waqt mujhey ghussa aa gaya. maine aik tamaancha laga diya ( ghussey mein ye khata mujh se ho gai) Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ( dekho khayal rakho (aur paighambaron par mujh ko fazeelat na do qiyamat ke din aisa hoga sab log ( haibat khudawandi se) behosh ho jaeinge phir main sabse pahley hosh mein aaoonga . kya dekhunga Musa (Alaihissalam) ( mujh se bhi pahley) arsh ka aik kona thaamey khadey hain. ab ye main nahi janta ke wo mujh se pahley hosh mein aa jaeinge ya kohe-toor par jo (duniyaa mein) behosh ho chukey they iske badal wo aakhirat mein behosh hi na hongey."